<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB STARTS SAFILO AS HOLD.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB STARTS SAFILO AS HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB initiated coverage of Italian spectacle frame maker Safilo SpA with a &quot;hold&quot; rating and valued the shares at 44,000 lire, the investment bank said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Safilo has increasingly challenged Luxottica Group SpA, the investment bank said, but it does not have the financial resources in the U.S. to match Luxottica.</p>
<p>CSFB estimates 1997 earnings per share of 1,747 and 1998 of 2,330.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
